        "updated_at": "2026-10-10T18:01:35Z",
        "body": "Implements a carried-grid, nonautonomous CR response under a prescribed100 K density bath. The first512-step failure and traceback remain intact; one approved1024/2048-step repair passes fresh Astra independent review within the frozen2e-4 numerical criterion.\n\nScope: grid128,20/100/1000 eV impulses, proper interval0..1e13 s and five saved epochs. Cold physical operator, thermal feedback, continuum, Bianchi coupled history and global scientific admission remain HOLD.\n\nValidation: maximum reference error decreases .0013005338 → .0002761667 → .0000732987; daughter quadrature difference3.85e-9; constant/legacy difference7.61e-15. Number/energy ledgers, positivity and exact HeII structural zero pass. Review and original raw outputs are under `research/cr_nonautonomous_prescribed_density01_20261011/`. Timing measures only the campaign after imports.\n\nThis draft is stacked on PR25. Recovery bundle verified with restored commit/tree/result readback before non-force publication. No solver rerun or source/model change was made during publication.\n",
